V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span> (set parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cls}\">\\(\\mathsf{Cls}\\)</span> (metalinguistic collection of classes)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (class-level strong-embedding witness scheme, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"280579b7b61aec2e\" href=\"?note=280579b7b61aec2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-lc-strong-cardinal-embedding.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-lc-strong-cardinal-embedding.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metalinguistic predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> (metalinguistic marker)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\\)</span> 是保留的调用名，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 表示完全相同的元语言性质；三个实参都是集合，但谓词展开含类量词，不声称它是纯 ZFC 的集合公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}witness} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\delta\\land A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\exists M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,M,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land j(A)\\cap V_\\lambda=A\\cap V_\\lambda\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}witness} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\delta\\land A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\land\\forall\\lambda&lt;\\delta\\;\\Bigl(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\\exists M,j\\in\\mathsf{Cls}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S(j,M,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\land j(A)\\cap V_\\lambda=A\\cap V_\\lambda\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}witness\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}witness\\text{-}alias}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This states that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\delta\">\\(&lt;\\delta\\)</span>-strong for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, the standard witness appearing in the Woodin-cardinal characterization.</li>\n<li>Quantification over the class embedding and its class target is metalinguistic; it is not disguised as first-order set quantification.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-lc-strong-cardinal-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"280579b7b61aec2e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-lc-strong-cardinal-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-lc-strong-cardinal-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"280579b7b61aec2e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLcStrongCardinalEmbedding}_S$ (class-level strong-embedding witness scheme, see [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-lc-strong-cardinal-embedding.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Cls}","display":false},{"tex":"\\m